                                                "sense_id": "c6dd4260-1315-39cb-a1ef-54323c61ee4b",
                                                "text": "The government has been in a paralysis since it lost its majority in the parliament."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8dfcf14-d1c0-47b9-9bf7-f2e063aae35b",
                                                "sense_id": "c6dd4260-1315-39cb-a1ef-54323c61ee4b",
                                                "text": "Until then, the Sunak administration remains a study in ineffectuality on multiple fronts, leading Goldsmith to cite, not unreasonably, “a kind of paralysis”."
